    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton manager for the pivot-use toggle. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When enabled, model rotation and positioning use the object&apos;s transform origin as the pivot; when disabled the bounds center is used instead. Must be initialised by calling Initialize (done by MiscOptionsManager). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
